# creative-studio: optional keys. Nothing here is required; without keys the
# studio uses key-free sources (Google Trends RSS, Wikipedia, Hacker News,
# public Telegram previews) plus Claude's web search, or cached snapshots.
#
# Put real values either in your shell environment (exported before starting
# `claude`) or in <state dir>/.env, where <state dir> is printed by
# `cstudio log stats` (default ~/.claude/plugins/data/creative-studio-<marketplace>/).
# Never commit a filled .env.

# YouTube Data API v3 key: enables youtube_trending.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=

# Apify API token: enables read-only TikTok / Instagram hashtag scraping (social_search).
APIFY_TOKEN=
# Optional: override which Apify actors are used.
# APIFY_TIKTOK_ACTOR=clockworks~tiktok-scraper
# APIFY_INSTAGRAM_ACTOR=apify~instagram-hashtag-scraper

# Optional: put all studio state (log, taste profile, brands, runs) in a folder
# you control, e.g. a git repo. Default is the plugin data dir that survives updates.
# CREATIVE_STUDIO_HOME=~/creative-studio-state

# Optional: which brand file in <state dir>/brand/ is active (file name without .md).
# CREATIVE_STUDIO_BRAND=

# Optional: Hugging Face token only raises download rate limits for the embedding model.
# HF_TOKEN=
